00:39:31.480 --> 00:39:33.880
we have to figure
out a way to transmit

00:39:33.880 --> 00:39:37.270
the power from in
this realm all the way

00:39:37.270 --> 00:39:38.710
across the whole
country, if we're

00:39:38.710 --> 00:39:41.050
going to be successful
with solar power.

00:39:41.050 --> 00:39:44.860
And similarly with
wind power, some

00:39:44.860 --> 00:39:47.570
of the eastern and western
seaboard look great,

00:39:47.570 --> 00:39:49.480
but then the center
of the country

00:39:49.480 --> 00:39:51.910
is kind of in trouble,
if we just go with wind.

00:39:51.910 --> 00:39:56.230
So comparing the
