So if you can look around your
leaving group and collect a few

01:37:19.450 --> 01:37:22.570
and bring them in, that will
make our lives a lot easier

01:37:22.570 --> 01:37:23.830
soon.

01:37:23.830 --> 01:37:25.720
And then the other
thing is just a reminder

01:37:25.720 --> 01:37:28.990
that you should be practicing
un poco espanol, por favor.

01:37:28.990 --> 01:37:31.990
So please, do.

